# Varda is a library, not an application. A committed lockfile pins one
# resolution that no consumer inherits — pip and uv both resolve against the
# ranges in `pyproject.toml` — while adding a large diff to every dependency
# change. Kept local so `uv sync` still works here.
uv.lock
